---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Refund & Cancellation Policy - Banners All Over" description="Refund and Cancellation Policy for Banners All Over Shopify app subscriptions">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL} class="inline-flex items-center text-bao-blue hover:text-bao-blue-600 transition-colors mb-6">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Home
      </a>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Refund & Cancellation Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600">Last Updated: December 2, 2025</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">

      <!-- Introduction -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">1. Introduction</h2>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          This Refund and Cancellation Policy explains how subscriptions to Banners All Over ("we," "us," "our," or "BAO") work, how you can cancel your subscription, and under what circumstances refunds are provided.
        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          All subscriptions to Banners All Over are processed through Shopify's billing system. By subscribing to a paid plan, you agree to the terms outlined in this policy as well as Shopify's billing terms.
        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Please read this policy carefully before subscribing to any of our paid plans.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Subscription Plans -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">2. Subscription Plans and Billing</h2>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">2.1 Available Plans</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Banners All Over offers four subscription tiers:
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-3 mb-4">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800">Basic Plan - FREE</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Limited features, no billing required</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800">Standard Plan</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-1">
              <strong>Monthly:</strong> $20/month (discounted to $15/month)
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
              <strong>Annual:</strong> $240/year (discounted to $180/year - save 25%)
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg border-2 border-bao-blue">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800">Pro Plan <span class="text-xs bg-bao-blue text-white px-2 py-1 rounded">MOST POPULAR</span></h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-1">
              <strong>Monthly:</strong> $40/month (discounted to $30/month)
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
              <strong>Annual:</strong> $480/year (discounted to $360/year - save 25%)
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800">Business Plan</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-1">
              <strong>Monthly:</strong> $200/month (discounted to $150/month)
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
              <strong>Annual:</strong> $2,400/year (discounted to $1,800/year - save 25%)
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">2.2 Billing Cycles</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Monthly Subscriptions:</strong> Billed on the same day each month from when you subscribed</li>
          <li><strong>Annual Subscriptions:</strong> Billed once per year on the anniversary of your subscription date</li>
          <li><strong>Free Plan:</strong> No billing; available indefinitely with limited features</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">2.3 Payment Processing</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          All payments are processed by Shopify through their app billing system. We do not directly handle or store your payment information. For questions about payment processing, please refer to <a href="https://www.shopify.com/legal/terms-payments-us" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Shopify's Payment Terms</a>.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">2.4 Automatic Renewal</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Your subscription will automatically renew at the end of each billing period unless you cancel before the renewal date. You will be charged the then-current price for your subscription plan.
        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-700">
          <strong>Renewal Notifications:</strong> We may send you a reminder before your subscription renews, but you are responsible for tracking your renewal date and canceling if you no longer wish to continue.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Cancellation Policy -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">3. Cancellation Policy</h2>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">3.1 How to Cancel</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          You can cancel your Banners All Over subscription at any time using one of the following methods:
        </p>

        <div class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-4">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Method 1: Through Shopify Admin (Recommended)</h4>
          <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
            <li>Log in to your Shopify admin panel</li>
            <li>Go to <strong>Apps</strong> in the left sidebar</li>
            <li>Find <strong>Banners All Over</strong> in your installed apps</li>
            <li>Click the <strong>Delete</strong> or <strong>Uninstall</strong> button</li>
            <li>Confirm the uninstallation</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-4">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Method 2: Through Shopify Billing Settings</h4>
          <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
            <li>Log in to your Shopify admin panel</li>
            <li>Go to <strong>Settings</strong> → <strong>Billing</strong></li>
            <li>Find <strong>Banners All Over</strong> under App charges</li>
            <li>Click <strong>Cancel subscription</strong></li>
            <li>Confirm the cancellation</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-4">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Method 3: Contact Support</h4>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
            If you need assistance canceling, contact our support team:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-1">
            <li>Email: <a href="mailto:support@bannersallover.com" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">support@bannersallover.com</a></li>
            <li>Support Form: <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}docs/support-feedback`} class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">Contact Support</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">3.2 Effect of Cancellation</h3>

        <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Monthly Subscriptions:</h4>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Immediate Effect:</strong> When you cancel, your subscription remains active until the end of your current billing period</li>
          <li><strong>Access:</strong> You can continue to use all features of your paid plan until the end of the period you've already paid for</li>
          <li><strong>No Further Charges:</strong> You will not be charged for the next billing cycle</li>
          <li><strong>Automatic Downgrade:</strong> After your paid period ends, your account automatically downgrades to the Free Basic plan</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Annual Subscriptions:</h4>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Immediate Effect:</strong> When you cancel, your subscription remains active until the end of your annual period</li>
          <li><strong>Access:</strong> You retain full access to your plan's features for the remainder of the year you've paid for</li>
          <li><strong>No Renewal:</strong> Your subscription will not renew for another year</li>
          <li><strong>Automatic Downgrade:</strong> After your annual period ends, you'll be moved to the Free Basic plan</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">3.3 Downgrading Plans</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Instead of canceling completely, you can downgrade to a lower-tier plan:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>Downgrade takes effect at the end of your current billing period</li>
          <li>You continue to have access to your current plan's features until the billing period ends</li>
          <li>You will be charged the lower price starting from the next billing cycle</li>
          <li>Any banners or slides exceeding the new plan's limits will be disabled (but not deleted)</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">3.4 Re-Subscribing</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          You can re-subscribe to any paid plan at any time by reinstalling the app or upgrading from within the app settings. Re-subscribing will start a new billing period immediately.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Refund Policy -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">4. Refund Policy</h2>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">4.1 General Refund Policy</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          <strong>Monthly Subscriptions:</strong> Generally non-refundable. When you cancel, you receive access through the end of your paid period, which serves as your "money's worth."
        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          <strong>Annual Subscriptions:</strong> [SPECIFY REFUND POLICY - Options below]
        </p>

        <div class="bg-yellow-50 p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-yellow-400 mb-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-800">
            <strong>Note to Business Owner:</strong> Please specify your annual refund policy. Common options:
          </p>
          <ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li><strong>Option A:</strong> Non-refundable, but service continues through paid period</li>
            <li><strong>Option B:</strong> Pro-rated refund for unused months (minus a processing fee)</li>
            <li><strong>Option C:</strong> Full refund within 30 days of purchase, pro-rated after 30 days</li>
            <li><strong>Option D:</strong> Full refund within 7-14 days, no refunds after that period</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">4.2 Exceptions and Special Circumstances</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          We may provide refunds at our sole discretion in the following circumstances:
        </p>

        <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Technical Issues:</h4>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>If the app experiences a <strong>major outage or malfunction</strong> that prevents core functionality for an extended period (e.g., 7+ consecutive days)</li>
          <li>If we <strong>discontinue the service</strong> before the end of your paid period, you will receive a pro-rated refund for the unused portion</li>
          <li>If there is a <strong>billing error</strong> where you were charged incorrectly or multiple times</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Service Not as Described:</h4>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>If the app <strong>fundamentally fails to deliver</strong> the features described on our pricing page and documentation</li>
          <li>Refund requests based on this reason must be submitted within <strong>7 days of subscription</strong></li>
          <li>You must provide specific details about which features are not functioning as described</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Incompatibility Issues:</h4>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>If our app is <strong>incompatible with your Shopify theme</strong> and we are unable to resolve the issue within 14 days</li>
          <li>Must be reported within <strong>14 days of subscription</strong></li>
          <li>Requires cooperation with our support team to attempt resolution</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">4.3 Non-Refundable Circumstances</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Refunds will <strong>NOT</strong> be provided in the following situations:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Change of mind:</strong> You simply no longer want to use the app</li>
          <li><strong>Failure to use:</strong> You subscribed but never used the app or features</li>
          <li><strong>Duplicate purchases:</strong> You subscribed to multiple plans by mistake (but we can help you cancel duplicates)</li>
          <li><strong>Violation of Terms:</strong> Your account was terminated for violating our Terms of Service</li>
          <li><strong>User error:</strong> Misunderstanding of features, failure to configure properly, or not reading documentation</li>
          <li><strong>Dissatisfaction with results:</strong> The app didn't improve your sales or conversions as hoped</li>
          <li><strong>Forgot to cancel:</strong> You forgot to cancel before auto-renewal (but we can help you cancel going forward)</li>
          <li><strong>Minor bugs or issues:</strong> Small bugs that don't prevent core functionality and are being addressed</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">4.4 How to Request a Refund</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          To request a refund, please follow these steps:
        </p>

        <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-3">
          <li>
            <strong>Contact Support:</strong>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
              <li>Email: <a href="mailto:support@bannersallover.com" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">support@bannersallover.com</a></li>
              <li>Subject line: "Refund Request"</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Provide Required Information:</strong>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
              <li>Your Shopify store URL</li>
              <li>Email address associated with your account</li>
              <li>Subscription plan and billing cycle (monthly/annual)</li>
              <li>Date of purchase</li>
              <li>Detailed reason for refund request</li>
              <li>Any relevant screenshots or documentation</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Allow Time for Review:</strong> We will review your request within <strong>5 business days</strong> and respond via email
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Refund Processing:</strong> If approved, refunds are processed through Shopify and typically appear within <strong>5-10 business days</strong> depending on your payment method
          </li>
        </ol>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">4.5 Refund Timeframe</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Request Review:</strong> 5 business days to review and approve/deny</li>
          <li><strong>Processing:</strong> 3-5 business days after approval</li>
          <li><strong>Bank/Card Processing:</strong> Additional 5-10 business days depending on your financial institution</li>
          <li><strong>Total Time:</strong> Up to 20 business days from request to funds in your account</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Free Trial -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">5. Free Trials (If Applicable)</h2>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          [SPECIFY IF YOU OFFER FREE TRIALS]
        </p>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
            <strong>If free trials are offered:</strong>
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
            <li>Trial duration: [e.g., 7 days, 14 days, 30 days]</li>
            <li>Access: Full access to [specify plan level] features during trial</li>
            <li>Billing: No charges during trial period</li>
            <li>Cancellation: Cancel anytime during trial without being charged</li>
            <li>Auto-Conversion: If not canceled, trial automatically converts to paid subscription at the end of the trial period</li>
            <li>Reminder: Email notification [X days] before trial ends</li>
            <li>One Per Customer: Free trials are limited to one per Shopify store</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Price Changes -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">6. Price Changes</h2>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          We reserve the right to modify our pricing at any time. Price changes will be handled as follows:
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">6.1 Notice Period</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Existing Subscribers:</strong> At least 30 days' advance notice via email before any price increase</li>
          <li><strong>New Subscribers:</strong> New prices apply immediately upon subscription</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">6.2 When Price Changes Take Effect</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Monthly Subscriptions:</strong> New price applies at your next billing cycle after the notice period</li>
          <li><strong>Annual Subscriptions:</strong> New price applies at your next annual renewal date</li>
          <li><strong>Grandfathering:</strong> We may grandfather existing customers at their current price for a limited time at our discretion</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">6.3 Your Options</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          If you do not agree to a price increase, you may cancel your subscription before the new price takes effect. Your continued use of the service after the price increase date constitutes acceptance of the new pricing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Data After Cancellation -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">7. What Happens to Your Data After Cancellation</h2>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">7.1 Downgrade to Free Plan</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          If you cancel a paid plan but remain on the Free Basic plan:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Data Retention:</strong> All your banner data and settings are retained</li>
          <li><strong>Banners Exceeding Limits:</strong> Banners and slides beyond the Free plan limits (2 banners, 2 slides each) will be <strong>disabled but not deleted</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Re-upgrade:</strong> If you re-subscribe to a paid plan, all previously created banners become accessible again</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">7.2 Complete Uninstallation</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          If you completely uninstall the Banners All Over app from your Shopify store:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Grace Period:</strong> We retain your data for <strong>30 days</strong> in case you reinstall</li>
          <li><strong>Permanent Deletion:</strong> After 30 days, all your banner data, settings, and media files are <strong>permanently deleted</strong></li>
          <li><strong>No Recovery:</strong> After permanent deletion, we cannot recover your data</li>
          <li><strong>Backup Recommendation:</strong> Export any content you wish to keep before uninstalling</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">7.3 Requesting Data Deletion</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          You can request immediate deletion of your data by contacting us at <a href="mailto:privacy@bannersallover.com" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">privacy@bannersallover.com</a>. We will process your request within 30 days as outlined in our <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}legal/privacy`} class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- EU Consumer Rights -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">8. European Union Consumer Rights</h2>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          If you are a consumer based in the European Union, you have additional rights under EU consumer protection law:
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">8.1 14-Day Withdrawal Right</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Under the EU Consumer Rights Directive, you have the right to withdraw from your subscription within 14 days of subscribing, without giving any reason.
        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          <strong>To exercise your withdrawal right:</strong>
        </p>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>Send a clear statement of your decision to withdraw to <a href="mailto:support@bannersallover.com" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">support@bannersallover.com</a></li>
          <li>Include "EU Withdrawal Right" in the subject line</li>
          <li>Provide your Shopify store URL and subscription details</li>
        </ol>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          <strong>Refund Processing:</strong> We will refund all payments received from you within 14 days of receiving your withdrawal notice.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">8.2 Exception: Service Fully Performed</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          If you have requested that the service begins immediately upon subscription (which is standard for SaaS apps), you acknowledge that:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>You may lose your withdrawal right if the service is fully performed before the 14-day period ends</li>
          <li>However, you may still cancel and receive a pro-rated refund for the unused portion of the subscription period</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">8.3 Statutory Rights</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Nothing in this policy affects your statutory rights under EU law. Any terms that attempt to exclude rights you have under EU consumer protection legislation are void.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Contact for Billing Questions -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">9. Questions and Support</h2>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          If you have any questions about billing, cancellations, or refunds, please contact us:
        </p>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2"><strong>Banners All Over Support</strong></p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2"><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@bannersallover.com" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">support@bannersallover.com</a></p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2"><strong>Billing Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:billing@bannersallover.com" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">billing@bannersallover.com</a></p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2"><strong>Support Form:</strong> <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}docs/support-feedback`} class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">Contact Support</a></p>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Response Time:</strong> Within 1-2 business days (Priority support for Business plan customers)</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Shopify Billing -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">10. Shopify Billing System</h2>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          All subscription billing is managed through Shopify's secure billing system. For questions about:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Payment processing:</strong> Contact <a href="https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/billing" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Shopify Support</a></li>
          <li><strong>Payment methods:</strong> See <a href="https://www.shopify.com/legal/terms-payments-us" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Shopify Payment Terms</a></li>
          <li><strong>Billing disputes:</strong> Contact both Shopify Support and our support team</li>
          <li><strong>Updating payment info:</strong> Manage through your Shopify admin → Settings → Billing</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Related Policies -->
      <section class="mb-8">
